<title>ARGENTINA: Minera Alumbrera to sell LG Metals concentrate.</title>
<headline>Minera Alumbrera to sell LG Metals concentrate.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Minera Alumbrera Ltd said Friday it had agreed to sell LG Metals Corp of South Korea 100,000 tonnes of copper and gold concentrate per year between 1998-2007.</p>
<p>Minera said the contract, valued at $800 million, will be signed Monday to coincide with the visit of President Kim Young-sam.</p>
<p>There were no other details immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Gary Regenstreif, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0618</p>
